# choreo lane — regenerable run artifacts (precedent: benchmark2/iree/.gitignore,
# and homework-check.md item I4 which accepts a gitignored raw/ PROVIDED a
# provenance note explains re-derivation; see README.md "Provenance").
#
# What is deliberately NOT ignored: the small per-experiment JSON artifacts under
# raw/ that back the published numbers. manifest.md §8 requires "every number
# traces to raw JSON", so those are committed even though the logs are not.

# Bulk compile/run logs — regenerated by the corresponding run.sh subcommand.
raw/e1_logs/
raw/e2_logs/
raw/e4_logs/
raw/e5_logs/
raw/oracle_survey/
raw/oracle_calibration/
raw/probe_raw/
raw/*.log

# The E2 ledger is 8.8 MB and is fully re-derived into the committed register
# (results/choreo/obligation.jsonl, 17,353 records) by `./run.sh e2` +
# `./run.sh collect`. Committing both would duplicate the corpus in git.
raw/e2_ledger.json

# Superseded snapshots kept locally for audit but not part of the current claim.
raw/*.pre-reproject.json
raw/*.pre-exclusive.json
raw/*.oldclassifier.json

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
